# Package F "The Slow Boat": Jalil has the key to the stash (slow_boat_stash) that holds the a data chip.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('slow_boat_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Whatever you heard, it's cheaper elsewhere.
#
o_text: The Chiba chip. Kade wants it, and I'm the polite one he sent.
o_id: slow_boat_talk
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(slow_boat)') && !HasItem('slow_boat_stash_key')
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Easy')
o_succ: Yield
o_fail: Refuse
#
o_text: What's it worth to you if I never found you?
o_id: slow_boat_bribe
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(slow_boat)') && !HasItem('chiba_chip') && !HasFlag('slow_boat_paid')
o_goto: Bribe
#
o_text: What comes in on the freighters?
o_id: slow_boat_lore
o_goto: Lore
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: slow_boat_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Lore
npc: Chips, meds, guns. Never people. Ships come in full of cargo and leave full of cargo. Think about that next time you see a lottery slip.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: slow_boat_lore_back
o_goto: Default

name: Yield
npc: (He weighs you up and loses.) Fine. Here's the key. The courier was dead when I found him, I swear it.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'slow_boat_stash_key', 1)
effect: EndConversation

name: Refuse
npc: Polite doesn't scare me. Get out.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribe
npc: (He counts it out fast.) Two-fifty and you tell Kade I skipped town. The chip's worth ten times that to the right people.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 250)
effect: SetFlag('slow_boat_bribed')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: We never met. Keep it that way.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Mind your step.
effect: EndConversation
